WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.763
Welcome.

2
00:00:00.763 --> 00:00:04.463
This is the technical deep dive
for AI Identity Governance,

3
00:00:04.463 --> 00:00:07.937
one of the books of the
Federal Modernization Workbook.

4
00:00:07.937 --> 00:00:12.093
It's for identity engineers, security
engineers and platform owners,

5
00:00:12.093 --> 00:00:16.613
the people who issue the credentials AI
signs in with and watch what it does.

6
00:00:16.613 --> 00:00:20.795
The book's idea is simple: an AI
agent that can act is an account,

7
00:00:20.795 --> 00:00:23.388
and it needs what every account needs.

8
00:00:23.388 --> 00:00:26.974
An owner, a credential,
limits, and an end.

9
00:00:26.974 --> 00:00:29.975
Part 1 is the identity and the inventory.

10
00:00:29.975 --> 00:00:32.537
Part 2 is governing it and proving it.

11
00:00:32.537 --> 00:00:34.288
One note before we start:

12
00:00:34.288 --> 00:00:39.100
the product details here are dated
October 2026, and they move fast.

13
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.510
Let's begin with why.
